  "title": "Long rainbow arithmetic progressions",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "For $k\\in \\mathbb{N}$ let $T_k$ denote the minimal number $t\\in \\mathbb{N}$ such that there is a rainbow $AP(k)$ in every equinumerous $t$-coloring of $\\{ 1,2,\\ldots,tn\\}$ for every $n\\in \\mathbb{N}$\n\nConjecture For all $k\\geq 3$, $T_k=\\Theta (k^2)$.",
